Regional Account Management & Strategy: Examine the dedicated region, establishing clear and detailed analysis of HC customers and their needs. Determine partner quantity and quality in the dedicated region for HC, forming action plans to reach this targeted level by finding new partners while ensuring long-term partnerships with existing customers in the dedicated region. Follow HC general strategies and localize action plans for the dedicated region.
